Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nuntil her curtain call.
