Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aren't fighting signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smell is similar, but\Nin reality it's poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He figured out the secrets of my abilities\Nand used them to lure me into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't lost yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I expel the poison first...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.25,0:05:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water absorbent polymer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soundmaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any competent assassin can tell what\Nyou're able to pull off takes great skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But stunts as complicated as\Nyours require specific conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I use my abilities, it\Nshaves off a little of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're similar, I knew\Nwhat you'd need to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first time mixing a poisonous\Ngas with fight insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly the\Neasiest task in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:06:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but laying traps like\Nthis is my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Master, I've super gotta\Nthank you for buying into my lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Kinosaki\Npicking up taking me down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck yet. Shit.\NWon't stop the hysteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of options. Who's\Nthe youngest after Ureshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on this way I found an old road\Nwest of the village that leads into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, except change of plans. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got to go back to the\Nothers are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they won't stop till they kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to escape before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd just be saving myself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will someone else get\Nsacrificed in my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My classmates for the rest of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't leave, but I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, Osawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to placate Lord Chladni.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks, but someone's gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake, flame devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, there's\Nnothing to worry about. I
