Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when you speak relax\Nyour body and project from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:08:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your diaphragm if it feels slow\Nthen that's the right pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh and use this perfume it's\Na hit with both men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My without fail go-to brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to go along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm helping because you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come so far since we met. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't work, run. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now... Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's someone like you going to\Nexorcise the Great Lord Chladni?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been running this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were scared of being sacrificed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all bark, no bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're that strong, you\Nwould have done it sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you want all of us\Nto die! Liar! You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited, because I needed\Nto let my energy build up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that it has, I've\Nreturned to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really can, then\Nhurry up and exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I do? Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't mess this up or someone is going
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to die and everyone's\Nlives will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I've got anything to\Nsay about it, my dear flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you give the signal,\NI guess up the actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dead leaves, so it should burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking a lot of you, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the toughest job:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,selling the illusion and making\Nthem believe magic is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Chladni has passed\Non to the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now that that's done...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we build a campfire? Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it worked out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you, Super 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't lose because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshi no won by overcoming her weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weaker fated to die sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:11:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and dying at his little brother's\Nhands is the best he can hope for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I've\Nnever been super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense to spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's a special occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want to\Nheal yourself, Naruko,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little dose of\Nvulnerability goes a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Master Hikaru Gero,\Nthat's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A campfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard the legends before, but\NI didn't believe they were real!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshino says she has a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you'll like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a super-sized Pixie Bucks Bix-kit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in a fight to the death and\Nthis is the most damage you've taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki, you don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a historic event!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world record for the biggest\NDIY candy kit hasn't been
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,broken in 22 years but this one\Njust blew it out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I had the weirdest dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Odashina was a real witch\Nand fought a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like an omnioji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, a spirit medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good at magic tricks, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like our ride's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough, Mr. Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me and smoothed things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a little memory\Nsuppression, nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dad used to pat people's heads, and\Nit's just something I picked up from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pat his head to your\Nheart's content, Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to learn to take a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of everything you\Ndid, no one had to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I got to make some absolutely amazing\Nmemories that'll stay with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But getting to meet and know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna treasure that one most of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, but, you know,\Ndon't forget Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:13:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kinosaki already got her headpats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got it out of the way\Nwhile you weren't looking.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.97,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}Together {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}With Me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, I can't accept payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll super return the full amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll handle it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for a super dip in a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An emerging refreshed in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sound Master just walked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.69,0:14:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good thing you sought\Nout a superior hitman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my old partner here\Nwill blow her into paste!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? No one left in your\Ncorner. Stay back. You want my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would that be enough Maybe my fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just one thing please teach me how
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to run a business i want to do work\Nthat takes All the gloom in the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world and makes it disappear like\Nmagic after everything i did you i know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You value the future of the Balzak\Ncompany more than your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worked yourself to death to help\Nmy dad turn it into what it is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, it's up to you whether\Nto honor my will or not, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you think Shiori has what it takes\Nas CEO, do me a favor and lend her a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.61,0:15:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we can make this company soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm as strict as the devil, and\NI'm going to put you through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, with their help, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did get Ureshino's\Ncontact info, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only dealt with human garbage before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until I met her and Himekawa\Nthat the truth finally hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out this world of ours isn't\Nas grimy and bleak as I thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting married isn't what\NUreshino needs right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd only get in her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After considering how she\Nwould feel, I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always be thoughtful of the\Nother person's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you two could have hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, on to the next girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, both of us haven't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to let's have a\Ndrinking party a fun one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does everyone have something\Nto drink ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, then since we're ready
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, did you happen to\Ncatch this week's ropes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Short for termination to survive, but\Nthey said they're going to win 10–30!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other day, I rode a real-life\Nshark. A shark? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chomsky, Inosaki, rode him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is as rough as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't keep a conversation\Ngoing if their lives depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already knew that, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention they're from two\Ndifferent worlds with nothing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing on hard mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't have much\Ntrouble talking on the trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that it's just\Nthem they're clamming
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rift will form between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried butting out, but\Nthey leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take charge and\Nrevive this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you two, allow me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to demonstrate a new party\Ntrick I came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do remember last time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but if the mood gets any more\Nhellish, even I won't be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, what are you going to do, Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spew liquid DIY candy out of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't ruin your\Nchances with Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this flower matches my scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love these!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think all a party trick\Nhad to do was get attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just goes to show you how much I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to see that actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole point is to do something\Nthat entertains you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came up with a new trick\Ntoo, if you want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'll like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.19,0:20:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might suck at\Ntalking, but if they found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a different way of\Nconnecting with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess uh well be the best you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.03,0:20:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't see you again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my mission's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't guess, but I\Nactually have a greedy side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are tons of things I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the thought of missing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go to college\Nand run the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:20:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.93,0:21:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even fall in love, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to say\Nthanks for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.99,0:21:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiori, your chariot awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I had a whole lot\Nof fun hanging out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.87,0:21:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I almost forgot to\Nask if you'd add me as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And through this, I'd\Nlike to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I planned out 65,536 scenarios\Ngiving him to add me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I still almost have\Na heart attack asking!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.67,0:21:45.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs25\t(\fs25.5)\b1\frz12.8\fax0.2\c&H323230&\move(264,194,262,194)\frx10\fry2}Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if Ureshino knows into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was that her just being polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a total mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:21:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, there's no\Nneed to rush things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:21:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Building any relationship takes some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, how about we start\Nour next operation on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it then. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have other plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend is getting married.
